# A planted ledger: a throw row that names the object of the call of substr in the base library foundation, and
# the import of the planted configuration.  The rule judges the imports of each build, so a control of the throws
# holds its imports too.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZSt24__throw_out_of_range_fmtPKcz@GLIBCXX_3.4.20 | -
@build/libfoundation.a | throw | admit | helper.cpp.o | a planted throw through a helper of libstdc++
